        <technology>
            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses xml:lang="en">Stirling motor for combustion of wood pellets. Power range: 1-3 kW electrical output, 4.5-10.5 kW heat output. Includes pellet storage volume for one day of operation. Electrical efficiency 23%, total efficiency 90%. Performance, lifetime and maintenance intervall according to expected future values for a serial product.\n\n# Included processes\nThe module includes an estimation for materials and transport used for the maintenance of the Stirling cogeneration unit</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
